OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits murder of woman missing
OL,4,Afor 28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to the murder
OL,7,Fof a woman who went missing 28 years
OL,8,Fago.
OL,10,FPatricia Lashley, who would now be aged
OL,11,F61, was last seen near her home on Hall
OL,12,FStreet, Dudley in September 1998.
OL,14,FThis breaking news story is being
OL,15,Fupdated and more details will be
OL,16,Fpublished shortly. Please refresh the
OL,17,Fpage for the fullest version.
